      "pose": "explain",
      "vo": "That is the whole algorithm. Eight lines. The notebook is a dictionary called seen. Work out the partner. In seen? Return both positions. Else, write this number down.",
      "data": {
        "file": "two_sum.py",
        "lines": [
          "def two_sum(nums, target):",
          "    seen = {}",
          "    for i, x in enumerate(nums):",
          "        need = target - x",
          "        if need in seen:",
          "            return [seen[need], i]",
          "        seen[x] = i",
          "    return []"
        ],
